      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 7. **Membership.** Members of the Advisory Board shall be selected by the Commissioner of Business Services upon consultation with the Deputy Mayor for Finance and Economic Development. The Advisory Board shall consist of small business owners, including those persons, firms, corporations, or other enterprises which operate small businesses; industry, merchants, and trade associations; and other organizations which represent small businesses in the City. There shall be at least twenty-five and no more than fifty members on the Advisory Board. Advisory Board members shall serve for a term set by the Deputy Mayor for Finance and Economic Development.",
